  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (4)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (4) is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned at
    the bottom-center-center of the engine, made of Material.003, which helps to
    seal the oil pan and maintain engine performance. Its central location and specific
    material ensure a reliable seal, and an interesting detail is that it is designed
    to be replaced easily during maintenance.
